<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n113389" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χᾰρ-ίσιος</span></b>  [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῑ], <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">α</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>of thanksgiving,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἕδνον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Call.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					193
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>free,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρίσια</span>”
				<i>free gifts,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Isid.</u>
					216
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαρισία βοτάνη</span>
			<i>love-plant,</i> used as a philtre, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				846b7
			</span></i>, Ps.-<i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Fluv.</u>
				17.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χ. πλακοῦς,</span> a sort of cake, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Fr.</u>
				202
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πέττουσα τὸν χ.</span> (sc.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλακοῦντα</span>) <i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				2
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Ath.
				15.668c
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ Χαρίσια</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἱερά</span>), 
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Χαριτήσια</span>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				1843.24
			</span></i>.</div>
